_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","relation":"biographical_origin","place":{"source_name":"魯","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin","source_id":"s-shiji121-rulin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p007","quote":"申公者，魯人也。高祖過魯，申公以弟子從師入見高祖于魯南宮。呂太后時，申公游學長安，與劉郢同師。已而郢為楚王，令申公傅其太子戊。戊不好學，疾申公。及王郢卒，戊立為楚王，胥靡申公。申公恥之，歸魯，退居家教，終身不出門，復謝絕賓客，獨王命召之乃往。弟子自遠方至受業者百餘人。申公獨以詩經為訓以教，無傳（疑），疑者則闕不傳。"}],"source_term":"魯人也","interpretation_note":"保留人物介紹中的人地原稱，不推定出生地、居住日期或現代轄區。相鄰人物不自動承受同一原籍。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p005","text":"及今上即位，趙綰、王臧之屬明儒學，而上亦鄉之，於是招方正賢良文學之士。自是之后，言詩於魯則申培公，於齊則轅固生，於燕則韓太傅。言尚書自濟南伏生。言禮自魯高堂生。言易自菑川田生。言春秋於齊魯自胡毋生，於趙自董仲舒。及竇太后崩，武安侯田蚡為丞相，絀黃老、刑名百家之言，延文學儒者數百人，而公孫弘以春秋白衣為天子三公，封以平津侯。天下之學士靡然鄉風矣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"今上","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"趙綰","kind":"person","person_id":"8dt_22t_v15","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"王臧","kind":"person","person_id":"fhl_wxh_rfr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0026","start":26,"end":34,"surface":"方正賢良文學之士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"申培公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"轅固生","kind