，申公以弟子從師入見高祖于魯南宮。呂太后時，申公游學長安，與劉郢同師。已而郢為楚王，令申公傅其太子戊。戊不好學，疾申公。及王郢卒，戊立為楚王，胥靡申公。申公恥之，歸魯，退居家教，終身不出門，復謝絕賓客，獨王命召之乃往。弟子自遠方至受業者百餘人。申公獨以詩經為訓以教，無傳（疑），疑者則闕不傳。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"x85_w53_dyq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"x85_w53_dyq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"呂太后","kind":"person","person_id":"neq_81h_l49","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"劉郢","kind":"person","person_id":"ibz_19q_kow","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"ibz_19q_kow","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0059","start":59,"end":62,"surface":"太子戊","kind":"person","person_id":"ibz_19q_kow_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"戊","kind":"person","person_id":"ibz_19q_kow_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"ibz_19q_kow","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"戊","kind":"person","person_id":"ibz_19q_kow_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"賓客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m007-0134","start":134,"end":136,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin","book_id":"b-shiji-121","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p008","text":"蘭陵王臧既受詩，以事孝景帝為太子少傅，免去。今上初即位，臧乃上書宿衛上，累遷，一歲中為郎中令。及代趙綰亦嘗受詩申公，綰為御史大夫。綰、臧請天子，欲立明堂以朝諸侯，不能就其事，乃言師申公。於是天子使使束帛加璧安車駟馬迎申公，弟子二人乘軺傳從。至，見天子。天子問治亂之事，申公時已八十餘，老，對曰：「為治者不在多言，顧力行何如耳。」是時天子方好文詞，見申公對，默然。然已招致，則以為太中大夫，舍魯邸，議明堂事。太皇竇太后好老子言，不說儒術，得趙綰、王臧之過以讓上，上因廢明堂事，盡下趙綰、王臧吏，後皆自殺。申公亦疾免以歸，數年卒。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"王臧","kind":"person","person_id":"fhl_wxh_rfr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"孝景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"8s8_8m3_upb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"今上","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"臧","kind":"person","person_id":"fhl_wxh_rfr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"趙綰","kind":"person","person_id":"8dt_22t_v15","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"綰","kind":"person","person_id":"8dt_22t_v15","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"綰","kind":"person","person_id":"8dt_22t_v15","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"臧","kind":"person","person_id":"fhl_wxh_rfr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"wxo_k8i_1it","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m008-0108","start":108,"end":110